# 🔐 SOC Level 1 Journey on TryHackMe

This repository documents my full step-by-step progress through **SOC Level 1** training on TryHackMe. It includes cyber defense frameworks, threat intelligence, network and endpoint monitoring, SIEM, digital forensics, phishing, and capstone labs.

---

## 📌 Sections Covered

1. Cyber Defence Frameworks  
2. Cyber Threat Intelligence  
3. Network Security & Traffic Analysis  
4. Endpoint Security Monitoring  
5. SIEM (Security Information & Event Management)  
6. Digital Forensics & Incident Response (DFIR)  
7. Phishing Analysis  
8. Capstone Challenges

